      "edition": "Monday 26 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury return",
          "heading": "Fin Baxter back from long layoff in Harlequins' 33-15 win over Saracens",
          "body": "Fin Baxter's return to the pitch came in Harlequins' 33-15 win over Saracens, and it was a notable one for England. Planet Rugby described his first outing after a long injury layoff as one where \"it really didn't look like he'd been out of the game for 10 months.\" He made a strong carry, won a scrum penalty in his first pack-down and went off at half-time, as expected. Baxter is also in Steve Borthwick's 36-man squad, named on Sunday for the November Nations Championship camp."
        },
