    "387": {
      "date": "2026-10-26",
      "edition": "Monday 26 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Preparation regret",
          "heading": "Cros says France lost 2023 quarter-final to Springboks in preparation",
          "body": "Francois Cros has said France lost the 2023 World Cup quarter-final against South Africa before a ball was kicked, blaming preparation rather than the 80 minutes. The Toulouse loose forward, who came off the bench in the 29-28 defeat, said the Springboks were more physical and that France \"were equally as good, if not better\" on individual skill. He has never watched the game back. Next month's Stade de France meeting with South Africa offers that chance."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
