        {
          "kicker": "URC interpro",
          "heading": "Leinster and Munster meet in Dublin's blockbuster URC interpro at Aviva Stadium",
          "body": "Leinster and Munster's blockbuster URC clash in Dublin is the other talking point on The 42 Rugby Weekly, sitting alongside Andy Farrell's 36-man November squad. Ciarán Kennedy and Murray Kinsella cover both on the podcast, which looks ahead to another big week in the URC. The programme's billing is a big interpro at Aviva Stadium, so Ireland followers get a derby and a squad debate in the same breath."
