          "kicker": "Ranking record",
          "heading": "Italy's best world ranking is No. 8, reached in 2007 and 2024",
          "body": "Italy's best position in the world rankings is No. 8, reached in 2007 and again in 2024. The current log tells a harder story: after three matches they are 11 of 12, with no wins, three defeats, 37 points scored and 131 conceded, a points difference of -94. The most recent of those games was a 10-57 loss to Australia in Round three. Italy's next match is South Africa in Round four."
        },
