          "kicker": "Selection watch",
          "heading": "Reuben Morgan-Williams scores two tries in Ospreys' 31-14 derby win over Dragons",
          "body": "Reuben Morgan-Williams scored two tries as the Ospreys beat the Dragons 31-14 at the newly developed St Helen's on Saturday, a performance that strengthens his case for a Wales place. WalesOnline's ratings gave him an 8 out of 10, the highest mark in the piece, and noted he heads into Wales camp with a chance to establish himself in the matchday 23."
        },
