          "heading": "Ireland fly-half Sam Prendergast's wrist injury raises doubt for Argentina Test",
          "body": "Ireland's fly-half picture is the open question before the November meeting with Argentina. RTÉ Sport reported that a wrist injury has made Sam Prendergast a doubt, and Irish coverage has since described it as a major injury scare, with his absence from a Munster match also reported. No clarification of his fitness has been reported yet. Contepomi names his November squad after the London camp, which runs Monday to Wednesday."
        },
