          "kicker": "Team selection",
          "heading": "Les Kiss starts Declan Meredith at fly-half in Bledisloe shake-up",
          "body": "Kiss made four changes to the starting XV for the second Bledisloe Cup Test, the most notable being Declan Meredith's selection at fly-half, as Australia's long search for a first-choice No. 10 continues. Australia's last result was a 21-43 loss to New Zealand, and a first win over the All Blacks since 2020 was the prize on offer. Rugby World's preview said even a narrow defeat would be a sign of progress."
